  explains that he is alive thanks to  william  and that he intends to get william back  the battle begins  right away not a lot of chit chat not a  lot of talk no jutsu  just down to business yuno starts things  off with a piercing wind attack  and xenon blocks it using his bone magic  at this point xenon is very confident  that he is going to defeat yuno without  much problems  but yuno is not alone langris joins the  fray by launching his  archangel shoot down spell at xenon  this spell creates a bunch of spatial  magic spheres that fly at the enemy and  erase  anything that touches them but xenon is  able to stop langer's spheres by sealing  each and every one of them  inside his own spatial magic cubes  xenon basically counters spatial magic  with even stronger spatial magic  because his magic is able to dominate  the mana within  any space that it encompasses and  despite successfully countering his  attack  xenon actually praises langus's  abilities and said that if it wasn't for  him  langris would probably be the strongest  spatial magic user  but langris isn't distracted by xenon's  words he prepares to launch an even  stronger spatial magic spell called  archangel annihilation but before that  spell can hit its designated target  xenon uses a spell called spatial  domination  to create a massive spatial magic cube  that encompasses the entire hallway  this means that all three of them xenon  yuno and langris  are now located within the spatial magic  cube  that xenon has just created xenon  explains that a mage who enters this  space  cannot use any of their spells and since  both yuno and langris are already within  the space  xenon is confident that he is about to  kill them both right here and now  but that is when yuno unleashes his  secret weapon  he summons self aka bell use a spirit  dive  and unlocks a new transformation called  spirit of  boreas in his new form yuno has a full  crown  and a halberd which is a long spear-like  weapon that has both a spear tip  and a battle axe edge i have to say that  yuno's new form looks freaking awesome  and this form is definitely befitting of  the rightful spade kingdom ruler  the fact that juno's crown is now  complete suggests that he has now  learned to perform spirit dive with  belle  more effectively he has been able to  merge with her and her mana on a more  complete level  and that is why this form appears to be  more complete than his previous  spirit dive incarnation and that is why  it appears to be much stronger as well  i really like the fact that juno now has  a unique weapon of his own  osta's got his swords which are super  cool and now yuno's got his magical  shiny halberd that gives him a true  royal heir i also loved seeing yuno  standing up to xenon and vowing to get  revenge for his former defeat  after all yuno is still competing to  become the new wizard king it's not just  asta who wants to make this happen so  yuno can't become the wizard king unless  he defeats all of his enemies  and that includes xenon thanks to bell  and the spirit dive  yuno is able to overcome xenon's  absolute space spell  because he is loved by the mana of that  space  and so apparently this cancels out the  effects  of xenon's spell that's a turn of events  that genuinely surprises xenon  and that is no small feat because xenon  is not a man who is easily surprised  and so even though he is fighting inside  of xenon's huge  absolute space cube yuno is still able  to use his magic  and he proceeds to use that new epic  halberd to pierce through  xenon's bone magic shield juno's attack  actually manages to tear a large hole  in xenon's chest as xenon looks at his  own wound in shock  the awakened you know appears to have  won the fight and that is how this  chapter ends but not so fast despite  those last few panels of the chapter  there is no way that xenon has been  defeated so quickly we've already seen  both dante and vanica recover from even  worse wounds  multiple times so we should expect that  xenon will do the same  however the very fact that yuno was able  to land  such a blow on xenon in the first place  is a big deal  and as we see xenon himself is more  shocked  than anyone yuno is now significantly  stronger than he was the last time that  he and xenon fought  but does that mean that juno is actually  strong enough to defeat  xenon now i highly doubt that and that  is why langris is there to back yuno up  and even with language there once xenon  recovers from his injury and uses  80 percent of his devil's power yuno and  languras will still be outmatched  so that is why i think that yuno and  language have some other ace  up their sleeve i think that someone  else is going to show up and help them  fight xenon  including of course nozelle once he's  done dealing with the dark disciples  and potentially even mario leona after  she's done with the giant demon  outside the palace this chapter served  an important purpose  we needed to see yuno actually land this  surprise hit on xenon  because tabata wanted us to know just  how much stronger  yuno has become however actually  defeating xenon for good is a different  matter  altogether and that won't be so easy  knowing tabitha  this battle will involve a lot more  nuance than just  langris and yuno overpowering xenon  because oh hey  they both trained really hard i think  that we will see  a lot more mages joining the fight i  think that we will see a lot of teamwork  and strategy  and in the end asta's anti-magic will  end up being the key to taking down the  dark  triad so yeah i know that some people  out there will complain that yuno  shouldn't have gotten so strong so  quickly but you have to understand that  up to this point xenon was  underestimating yuno xenon was confident  in his victory and he didn't take yuno  or langris seriously  but now things have changed xenon knows  who he's dealing with and he is about to  go all  out in the next few chapters that is  wh